second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the population of Manvel?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 105, \"text\": \"of 18 and 24; 27.8% were from 25 to 44; 28.1% were from 45 to 64; and 9.2% were 65 years of age or older.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d00\", \"start\": 106, \"end\": 168, \"text\": \"The gender makeup of the city was 51.4% male and 48.6% female.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d00\", \"start\": 169, \"end\": 272, \"text\": \"As of the census of 2000, there were 370 people, 141 households, and 100 families residing in the city.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d00\", \"start\": 273, \"end\": 343, \"text\": \"The population density was 1,254.8 people per square mile (492.6/km²).\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d00\", \"start\": 344, \"end\": 432, \"text\": \"There were 144 housing units at an average density of 488.4 per square mile (191.7/km²).\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d00\", \"start\": 433, \"end\": 551, \"text\": \"The racial makeup of the city was 96.22% White, 0.81% African American, 1.35% Native American, 0.81% from other races,\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 12, \"text\": \"County seat.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d01\", \"start\": 13, \"end\": 132, \"text\": \"According to the United States Census Bureau, the city has a total area of , of which is land and , or 0.12%, is water.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d01\", \"start\": 133, \"end\": 249, \"text\": \"As of the census of 2000, Manvel had a population of 3,046, 1,085 households, and 870 families residing in the city.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d01\", \"start\": 250, \"end\": 317, \"text\": \"The population density was 130.7 people per square mile (50.5/km²).\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d01\", \"start\": 318, \"end\": 406, \"text\": \"There were 1,148 housing units at an average density of 49.3 per square mile (19.0/km²).\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d01\", \"start\": 407, \"end\": 560, \"text\": \"The racial makeup of the city was 65.7% White, 13.9% African American, 0.6% Native American, 8.6% Asian, 8.9% from other races, and 2.3% from two or more\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 53, \"text\": \"Two, with of additional space, began in January 2008.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d02\", \"start\": 54, \"end\": 76, \"text\": \"Gamma Construction Co.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d02\", \"start\": 77, \"end\": 120, \"text\": \"built this phase and SHW Group designed it.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d02\", \"start\": 121, \"end\": 162, \"text\": \"The school's capacity increased to 2,500.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d02\", \"start\": 163, \"end\": 456, \"text\": \"The expansion included a two-story academic building, with of space; an 800-seat auditorium; a nine classroom expansion to the fine arts wing, itself of space; an expansion of the weight room to of space, twice its previous size; and a parenting education and childcare building with of space.\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d02\", \"start\": 457, \"end\": 619, \"text\": \"Construction on the auditorium was delayed due to damages from Hurricane Ike in September 2008; the construction company had to replace the previous sets of steel\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Manvel\", \"scope\": \"2000 census\", \"claim\": \"As of the census of 2000, there were 370 people residing in the city of Manvel.\", \"answer\": \"370\", \"quote\": \"As of the census of 2000, there were 370 people, 141 households, and 100 families residing in the city.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0435-8a3df9164419:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Manvel\", \"scope\": \"2000 census\", \"claim\": \"As of the census of 2000, Manvel had a population of 3,046.\", \"answer\": \"3,046\", \"quote\": \"As of the census of 2000, Manvel had a population of 3,046, 1,085 households, and 870 families residing in the city.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"370\", \"3,046\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"370\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"3,046\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
